---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import imgSobre1 from "../../assets/foto.jpeg";
import imgSobre2 from "../../assets/foto.jpeg";
---

<section
  class="relative bg-[var(--cor-fundo-suave)] pt-12 sm:pt-16 lg:pt-24 pb-16 sm:pb-20 lg:pb-28 px-6 lg:px-12 overflow-hidden border-b border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/20"
>
  <div
    class="absolute top-10 right-10 w-96 h-96 bg-[var(--cor-destaque)]/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-0"
  >
  </div>
  <div
    class="absolute bottom-10 left-10 w-80 h-80 bg-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-0"
  >
  </div>

  <div
    class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center z-10"
  >
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 flex flex-col items-start text-left">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5 sm:mb-6">
        <span class="w-8 h-px bg-[var(--cor-secundaria)]"></span>
        <span
          class="text-[10px] sm:text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-[var(--cor-texto)]"
        >
          A Nossa História &amp; Essência
        </span>
      </div>

      <h1
        class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-[3.5rem] text-[var(--cor-texto)] leading-[1.18] sm:leading-[1.14] mb-5 sm:mb-6 tracking-tight"
      >
        Mais de uma década a cuidar da confiança e <span
          class="italic font-normal text-[var(--cor-destaque)]"
          >autoestima feminina</span
        > em Valongo.
      </h1>

      <p
        class="text-sm sm:text-base lg:text-lg text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] leading-relaxed font-light max-w-xl mb-7 sm:mb-8"
      >
        Nascemos da convicção de que o cuidado estético deve ir muito além do
        visual: é um ritual de tranquilidade, rigor técnico e valorização
        pessoal que transforma o quotidiano de quem nos visita.
      </p>

      <div
        class="w-full max-w-lg pt-5 sm:pt-6 border-t border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/30"
      >
        <div
          class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 divide-y sm:divide-y-0 sm:divide-x divide-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/25"
        >
          <div
            class="flex items-baseline justify-between sm:flex-col sm:justify-start py-3 sm:py-0 sm:pr-6"
          >
            <span
              class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[2px] font-semibold text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] sm:mb-1"
            >
              Fundação
            </span>
            <span
              class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-[var(--cor-texto)] tracking-tight"
            >
              Valongo
            </span>
          </div>

          <div
            class="flex items-baseline justify-between sm:flex-col sm:justify-start py-3 sm:py-0 sm:px-6"
          >
            <span
              class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[2px] font-semibold text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] sm:mb-1"
            >
              Trajetória
            </span>
            <span
              class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-[var(--cor-texto)] tracking-tight"
            >
              19<span
                class="text-[var(--cor-destaque)] text-base sm:text-xl font-sans"
                >+</span
              > Anos
            </span>
          </div>

          <div
            class="flex items-baseline justify-between sm:flex-col sm:justify-start py-3 sm:py-0 sm:pl-6"
          >
            <span
              class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[2px] font-semibold text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] sm:mb-1"
            >
              Propósito
            </span>
            <span
              class="font-serif text-lg sm:text-2xl lg:text-3xl text-[var(--cor-destaque)] tracking-tight"
            >
              Exclusividade
            </span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div
      class="lg:col-span-5 relative w-full flex items-center justify-center lg:justify-end mt-4 sm:mt-8 lg:mt-0"
    >
      <div class="relative w-full max-w-[340px] sm:max-w-[420px] aspect-[4/5]">
        <div
          class="absolute -inset-2.5 sm:-inset-3.5 border border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/45 rounded-3xl -rotate-2 pointer-events-none"
        >
        </div>

        <div
          class="relative w-[85%] h-[85%] ml-auto rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl ring-1 ring-black/5 bg-white"
        >
          <Image
            src={imgSobre1}
            alt="Ambiente e atendimento no espaço Klassy"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover block"
          />
          <div
            class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/20 via-transparent to-transparent pointer-events-none"
          >
          </div>
        </div>

        <div
          class="absolute -bottom-3 sm:-bottom-4 left-0 w-[48%] sm:w-1/2 aspect-square rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border-4 border-white shadow-xl ring-1 ring-black/10"
        >
          <Image
            src={imgSobre2}
            alt="Detalhe de tratamento estético"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover block"
          />
        </div>

        <div
          class="absolute top-2 left-2 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-sm border border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/30 rounded-xl py-1 px-3 sm:py-1.5 sm:px-3.5 shadow-xs"
        >
          <span
            class="text-[9px] sm:text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[1.5px] text-[var(--cor-texto)]"
          >
            Refúgio de Bem-Estar
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
